t(51, 1750, """On the legislation of marriage in Islam, within the sayings of the jurists, for faithfulness in conveying the idea .. the article is only an expansion of the explanation

The man is obligated to marry and has no other lawful option before him. Marriage is responsibilities and not a toy for the man. The man marries even though marriage for him is not mere enjoyment but many life responsibilities. If we asked any man in the world: Does logic tell you to run toward responsibilities on your own feet?! He will say: No, I am not mad. For there is no sane person in the world who seeks responsibility, asks for it, wishes for it, searches for it, plans to take it on, and strives to hang responsibility on his neck. Yet the man does all this and runs toward responsibility with the full force of his mind, convinced that there is no way out but this, contrary to all logic, and the reason is fear of Allah the Exalted lest he commit what is forbidden. So the proof that Islam protects the woman and not the man is what a very large number of non-Muslim men, or of the sinners among the Muslims, do when they do not marry and commit what is forbidden. That is why "almost" no one marries in the West, in China, in Russia, in wide regions of Africa, in Australia, in South America, and at a rate no longer small in India. So what does all this mean?

It is clear what it means .. the woman is not protected!

So who protects the woman today from the domination of rationalism and the logic of things over the man's mind, which will make him never marry? Who pushes the Muslim man to go against the logic of comfort and run on his own feet toward responsibilities and toil so that the woman may be protected? The man obeys his Lord so that the woman may be protected. The man obeys his Lord so that the woman may be cherished, honored and esteemed. So are the mistresses around the world honored and esteemed? Everyone knows they are not""")
